<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "A real-time character counter appears near the input box showing")}
  <code>{dgettext("help_features", "current/maximum")}</code>
  {dgettext("help_features", "(e.g.,")} <code>127/1000</code>).
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_features", "When It Helps")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The counter tells you how much room is left before you write a long message. You can shorten your text in time, or split it into two messages, instead of finding out at the end."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_features", "The limit is %{max} characters per message.", max: "1000")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The number updates on every key press, paste or deletion. It counts every character in the input, including spaces and formatting codes."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The number turns orange after %{warning} characters and red after %{danger}, so you can see the limit coming.",
      warning: "450",
      danger: "900"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "When you reach the limit, the input stops accepting more text. The server also rejects any message that is longer than the limit."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The Send button stays disabled while the input is empty, unless a file is attached."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Notes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The counter is shown on wider screens only. On a phone it is hidden to save space, but the same limit still applies. A message that contains only spaces or formatting codes is treated as empty and is not sent."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-smart-input">{dgettext("help_features", "Smart Input")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-paste-dialog">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Multi-Line Paste Dialog")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
